Coherent deps (dependencies) provides insights into the dependencies used by a
code base, resolving imports to the dependencies that supply those imports. The
Coherent OSS community presents this library to make the functionality available
for a variety of uses.

The Coherent System implements automatic dependency inference using
coherent.deps, allowing Python projects to avoid the need to declare
dependencies and to instead focus on the implementation.

pip-run leverages this library to enable on-demand installation of dependencies
required by scripts, as implied by their imports.
